    "If Dictation is also set to Press Right Command Key Twice, both will start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果听写也设成「按两下右 ⌘」，两个会一起触发。"
