            "value": "Skywrite 会把全部 %lld 条笔记搬到新文件夹，之后的新笔记也存在那里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skywrite won’t appear in the Dock or the menu bar. To get back here, open Skywrite again from Finder or Spotlight.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skywrite 不会出现在 Dock 和菜单栏。要回到这里，在访达或聚焦搜索里再打开一次 Skywrite。"
          }
