    "Text size": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file lists what Skywrite did, such as notes opening and closing, and which app was in front (for example com.google.Chrome). It never includes what you wrote in a note, and your home folder and user name are hidden.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件里记的是 Skywrite 做了什么，例如便签打开、关闭，以及当时在最前面的是哪个 App（例如 com.google.Chrome）。不会包含便签里写的内容，主文件夹和用户名也已隐去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photos you preview note backgrounds on come from these photographers on Unsplash. Thank you!": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外观页里用来预览便签背景的照片，来自 Unsplash 上的这些摄影师。谢谢他们！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then click where the note should go.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按完光标变十字，点哪里笔记就放哪里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They’ve been closed and unedited for longer than the time you chose. You can put them back from the Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它们关掉后，超过你选的时间都没改过。之后可以从废纸篓放回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes Skywrite and all associated data from this Mac.": {
